WEBVTT

00:06:28.663 --> 00:06:32.121
It's been seven years
since we passed that legislation

00:06:32.121 --> 00:06:33.871
and implemented that model.

00:06:35.246 --> 00:06:37.121
And the results are incredible.

00:06:37.496 --> 00:06:41.038
Colorado increased turnout significantly

00:06:41.038 --> 00:06:44.538
and now is one of the top states
for voter turnout

00:06:44.538 --> 00:06:46.788
and also one of the most secure.

00:06:47.621 --> 00:06:50.871
We also saw a reduction in costs.

00:06:51.579 --> 00:06:53.746
So, because more people
were voting at home,

00:06:53.788 --> 00:06:56.204
we didn't need as many poll workers,

00:06:56.246 --> 00:06:59.204
and we saw that reduce by over 70 percent.